vpk-html
========

vpk-html is part of the VPK monorepo and inherits its licensing terms.
The VPK monorepo is currently private; see the repository root for
authoritative licensing.

Third-party material
====================

The editorial document templates (`assets/templates/`), the 14 SVG diagram
primitives (`assets/diagrams/`), and the curated demos (`assets/demos/demo-*.html`)
are ported from tw93/kami (https://github.com/tw93/Kami) and re-skinned with
vpk-html's visual identity. The underlying layout, SVG geometry, and structure
are kami's work, used under the MIT License.

  kami — Copyright (c) tw93
  MIT License — https://github.com/tw93/Kami/blob/main/LICENSE

The 20 example pages snapshotted in `assets/html-effectiveness/`, and the
demos derived from them (`assets/demos/demo-*.html` restyled by
`scripts/port-engineering-demos.mjs`), originate from
ThariqS/html-effectiveness (https://github.com/ThariqS/html-effectiveness),
used under the Apache License 2.0.

  html-effectiveness — Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC
  Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/ThariqS/html-effectiveness/blob/main/LICENSE

The fonts shipped under `assets/fonts/` are committed local font assets used
to preserve the offline HTML artifact contract:

  - Geist
  - Geist Mono

Attribution is preserved in README.md.
